nt,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">DeepSeek发布新一代大模型DeepSeek-V4，支持百万上下文并实现极致定价</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI开源隐私过滤模型Privacy Filter，支持本地化PII脱敏处理</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI 在 ChatGPT 中推出 Workspace Agents 智能体支持团队协作</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌 DeepMind 推出解耦式 DiLoCo 架构，提升分布式训练鲁棒性与效率</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/216c63f43c702d3c66ec5d571818a6c2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌 DeepMind 近期推出解耦式 DiLoCo 分布式训练架构，旨在解决大规模模型训练中硬件故障导致的停滞问题。该架构将训练任务分散至多个异步、故障隔离的“学习单元”，各单元在本地完成多次梯度计算后，再将压缩后的梯度信息传递给外部优化器汇总。实验显示，在高硬件故障率环境下，DiLoCo 仍能维持 88% 的利用率，远高于标准数据并行训练的 27%。该架构显著降低了跨数据中心带宽需求，从 198 Gbps 降至 0.84 Gbps，使全球分布式训练在商业互联网基础设施下成为可能。此外，DiLoCo 具备自愈能力，支持在学习单元失效后继续训练并无缝重连。该系统还支持异构硬件混合使用，允许不同代数的 TPU 芯片协同工作，有效延长了旧设备使用寿命并缓解了硬件容量瓶颈。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">福客AI获得阿里巴巴战略投资，双方将共同推进电商领域AI Agent应用</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b570857c3f4a649f26e8c4d9abe20396.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">福客AI近日宣布获得阿里巴巴战略投资，双方将聚焦电商领域数字生产力提升，推动AI技术深度融入商家实际运营流程。此次合作旨在通过引入AI Agent，全面覆盖电商服务、导购、商品、交易及售后等关键环节，显著提升商家的客户接待效率、服务体验及整体经营质量。福客AI将利用该笔投资进一步强化产品研发与落地体系，助力商家构建完善的数字生产力体系。阿里巴巴作为行业领军企业，将通过此次合作将福客AI的专业技术能力引入其电商生态系统，加速行业向智能化、数字化转型。对于电商企业而言，AI Agent将成为提升运营效率与市场竞争力的核心工具，通过智能化服务实现经营流程的稳定执行，从而在激烈的市场竞争中占据优势。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek发布新一代大模型DeepSeek-V4，支持百万上下文并实现极致定价</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/96e1a439272c9263333d3cd96c192d9c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">DeepSeek于4月24日正式发布新一代大模型DeepSeek-V4，整体性能比肩顶级闭源模型。该模型支持100万tokens超长上下文，分为Flash轻量高效版与Pro高性能旗舰版。在数学、STEM、竞赛代码及Agentic Coding评测中，DeepSeek-V4-Pro表现优异，世界知识储备仅次于Gemini-Pro-3.1。定价方面，Flash版输入/输出成本分别为1元/2元（每百万tokens），Pro版为12元/24元。此次发布不仅刷新了开源模型在复杂长文档分析与自主Agent任务中的能力上限，更通过极致性价比进一步降低了顶级模型的使用门槛，为开发者与中小企业落地复杂AI应用提供了强力支持。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI开源隐私过滤模型Privacy Filter，支持本地化PII脱敏处理</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ed9417a97357bf4ad41be85508f85d78.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式开源隐私过滤模型Privacy Filter，该模型专为检测并脱敏文本中的个人身份信息（PII）而设计。Privacy Filter基于gpt-oss架构改造，采用双向token分类器设计，总参数量为15亿，活跃参数量为5000万。该模型支持12.8万token的超长上下文，具备在浏览器或笔记本电脑本地运行的能力，确保敏感数据无需上传至云端即可完成处理。在PII-Masking-300k基准测试中，该模型表现出色，F1分数达到96%，经过修正后可提升至97.43%。此次开源为开发者提供了高效的本地化隐私保护方案，显著降低了数据处理过程中的合规风险，有助于在处理敏感文本任务时提升数据安全性与处理效率。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI 在 ChatGPT 中推出 Workspace Agents 智能体支持团队协作</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e189c960baf28424a890510b7398c525.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI 于 4 月 23 日正式发布 Workspace Agents，旨在通过 ChatGPT 为团队提供协作智能体，处理复杂任务与长周期工作流。该功能由 Codex 提供底层支持，具备文件处理、代码运行、工具调用及记忆存储能力，支持全天候云端运行。Workspace Agents 可集成 Slack 并支持定时调度，能够执行从报告准备、代码编写到自动响应等多种办公任务。OpenAI 内部已部署软件审查员、产品反馈路由器等 5 种应用实例，显著提升了销售与会计团队的自动化处理效率。该功能目前面向 ChatGPT Business、Enterprise、Edu 及 Teachers 计划用户开放研究预览，在 2026 年 5 月 6 日前可免费使用，后续将转为积分计费模式。此举将分散的隐性知识转化为显性工</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
